    "title": "Fayetteville residents celebrate I-295 completion as Wake Co. waits on Complete 540 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dan Haggerty, WRAL anchor/reporter ,\n1 days ago As drivers in Wake County wait for the I-540 loop to be completed. Drivers in Cumberland County got relief on Tuesday. On Tuesday, hundreds of people attened a ribbon cutting ceremony for the Fayetteville loop of I-295. Officials in Fayetteville and with the North Carolina Department of Transportation (NCDOT) have been working on the 39-mile-long loop for 40 years. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
